#>texture_pressed_glass
#:material #!glass

~pressed-glass[glass]{frosted, bubbled, rain beads}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~pressed-glass[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "pressed glass"
science: "A cooled liquid with no crystal order; it bends light at every surface, so texture in glass is mostly what it does to what lies behind it."
